      "question": "What role does vaccination status play in this presentation?",
      "my_answer": "Lack of Hib vaccination significantly increases the risk of epiglottitis, as Haemophilus influenzae type b is a major causative pathogen.",
      "rationale": "Hib vaccine has drastically reduced the incidence of epiglottitis in children. Unvaccinated or incompletely vaccinated children are at much higher risk. This patient’s incomplete immunizations suggest susceptibility to vaccine-preventable invasive bacterial infections."
